We also understand that cash flow and timing matter. We do have financing options available, and we can also split the investment into two payments of $8,000 to make getting started more manageable. And remember, we stand behind the work with our guarantee: if we don't help you generate at least 2X your investment in new or recoverable revenue during our engagement, we'll continue working with you at no additional cost until we do.
:::

:::writing{variant="document" id="71426"}
Our first 90 days together are intentionally designed as an intensive growth phase. Most med spa owners come to us because they want more clients and more qualified leads, and our goal is to get the right acquisition strategy moving quickly so you can begin seeing momentum and measurable results within the first 30 days. But sustainable growth requires more than simply turning on ads. During those 90 days, we dig deep into your med spa, identify where revenue is leaking, build your Growth Blueprint, and implement the highest-impact strategies and systems needed to convert more opportunities into actual revenue. That initial phase requires significantly more strategy, implementation, and hands-on support, which is why it's structured as an upfront investment. After that foundation is built, our goal is not to disappear. We transition into a long-term growth partnership where we continue optimizing, evolving, and scaling what we've built together as your med spa grows.
:::
